B.TF=new A.bx(17,2,"\ud83e\udd1d","Client meeting in English","L\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u ti\xean m\xecnh \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n c\xf4ng ty g\u1eb7p kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\xe0i. M\u1ed9t m\xecnh. Kh\xf4ng c\xf3 s\u1ebfp \u0111i c\xf9ng. Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng t\u1eeb \u0110\u1ee9c, r\u1ea5t professional v\xe0 th\u1eb3ng th\u1eafn.",B.a_Y,B.UR,B.XI,"You are a German client who is very direct and detail-oriented. Ask tough questions about quality, pricing, and delivery. Expect precise answers and professional responses.","Client threatens to cancel contract over quality issue! Retain the client professionally","\ud83d\ude30")
